[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1918355495","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2335#issuecomment-1918355495","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2335","id":1918355495,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85yV8gn","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-31T04:23:35Z","updated_at":"2024-01-31T04:23:35Z","body":"This is a match to BSD-2-Clause, except the following differences:\r\n1) it adds at the beginning: \"This software is not subject to any export provision of the United States Department of Commerce, and may be exported to any country or planet.\"\r\n\r\n2) it adds the good old, \"immediately at the beginning of the file, without modification\" in the first clause \r\n\r\nAs to #1 - I'm pretty sure you can't simply disclaim export law in this way, so not really sure what to do about that...\r\n\r\nas to #2, we have two other submissions with this text - https://spdx.org/licenses/libutil-David-Nugent.html and https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/867964cc59d0b811c682b3501333fd4dd7d61eee/src/BSD-Source-beginning-file.xml\r\nbut neither match this in other ways so I lean to adding as a new license","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1918355495/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1919330714","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2335#issuecomment-1919330714","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2335","id":1919330714,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85yZqma","user":{"login":"swinslow","id":678569,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY3ODU2OQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/678569?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow","html_url":"https://github.com/swinslow","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/swinslow/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-01-31T15:24:25Z","updated_at":"2024-01-31T15:24:25Z","body":"Also +1 to add. I could take a guess at their intended meaning for the export clause, but not needed to interpret here  :) Same for the \"immediately at the beginning\" clause, perhaps problematic in practice but I'd say not an issue for these purposes.\r\n\r\nFine with proposed ID, for name I'd probably go with \"BSD 2-Clause - Ian Darwin variant\"","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1919330714/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1924789656","html_url":"https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2335#issuecomment-1924789656","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/2335","id":1924789656,"node_id":"IC_kwDOA0JFE85yufWY","user":{"login":"jlovejoy","id":5048659,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUwNDg2NTk=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5048659?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy","html_url":"https://github.com/jlovejoy","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jlovejoy/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2024-02-02T22:22:45Z","updated_at":"2024-02-02T22:22:49Z","body":"# License Inclusion Decision\r\n\r\n## Decision:\r\n\r\n- [x] approved\r\n- [ ] not approved\r\n\r\n## Name\r\nBSD 2-Clause - Ian Darwin variant\r\n## License ID\r\nBSD-2-Clause-Darwin\r\n## XML markup\r\nnone\r\n## Notes:\r\nThis is similar to BSD-2-Clause, except it adds \"immediately at the beginning of the file, without modification\" in the first clause and adds an attempt to disclaim export law in the beginning.\r\n\r\n## Next steps ##\r\nIf the license has been accepted, please follow [the accepted-license process to create the PR](https://github.com/spdx/license-list-XML/blob/main/DOCS/request-new-license.md#accepted-license-process). ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/spdx/license-list-XML/issues/comments/1924789656/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]